'cross-' prefix, but I think it means opposite (in this case). A [HoOA
suggests that Law and Cha are opposites of each other and that Law and
Cha are opposites of Neu, but also that Neu is not an opposite of them.

In the end it's an issue of worldview: If you are Neutrial, you are, in
some objective sense, in the middle of the axis, and strive for that
middle. Both Chaos and Law are wrong directions in themselves, but they
are distinct (and an opposite of your goal). If you are Chaotic
(Lawful), then just one direction seems to be an opposite, the Lawful
(Chaotic) one.

